---
/**
 * Print hook (P14 B3): the `media="print"` sheet a composed home mounts
 * when its pack declares `features.print` — hide the site chrome, keep
 * sections unbroken, and print link hrefs after their anchors so the
 * contact card + vCard URL survive on paper.
 *
 * Source kit (citation): HTML5 Boilerplate print media block
 * https://github.com/h5bp/html5-boilerplate/blob/main/dist/css/style.css —
 * skeleton `@media print { chrome { display: none } a[href]::after { content: attr-href } }`.
 * `is:inline` is load-bearing: Astro's hoisting strips the `media`
 * attribute on component styles, so the sheet must render verbatim where
 * the head slot places it (plain CSS, safe unprocessed).
 */
---
<style media="print" is:inline>
  .sf-skip-link,
  .sf-site-header,
  .sf-site-footer,
  nav[aria-label='Page sections'] {
    display: none !important;
  }
  section { break-inside: avoid; }
  a[href^='http']::after,
  a[href^='mailto']::after,
  a[href^='tel']::after {
    content: ' (' attr(href) ')';
  }
</style>
